  "goodToKnow": "Die Ferien are holidays from school or university, and the word is always plural. Summer holidays, die Sommerferien, are staggered by federal state to avoid traffic jams. Adults usually have Urlaub instead. Ferienhaus is a holiday house, and Ferienjob a summer job. The word comes from Latin feriae, festival days."
